      "id": "AC-01",
      "description": "ZCode 可从仓库根目录 marketplace 发现插件，并优先读取 .zcode-plugin/plugin.json；npm 包包含两份 ZCode 清单。",
      "status": "passed"
    },
    {
      "id": "AC-02",
